WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.733
Step 1. Confirm the intended school, guardian email and linked household. Never ask for the parent’s password.

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:18.733
Step 2. Have the parent use Forgot password on the parent sign-in page. They should use their own guardian email.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:28.561
Step 3. Check the email address and spam folder if the reset does not arrive. Avoid repeated invitations while a result is uncertain.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:39.348
Step 4. If sign-in succeeds but the child is missing, verify the guardian-to-family link. Do not create another family to work around a linking problem.

00:00:39.348 --> 00:00:51.186
Step 5. Escalate with the school, guardian identifier, time, exact error and safe screenshot. Access or identity repairs require the authorized process.

00:00:51.186 --> 00:01:01.649
Verify the result. The parent signs in with their own credentials and sees only the correct family and children. Email acceptance alone does not prove access.

